ref←CopyRumba enforce;fullpath;path
⍝ Copies Rumba from its workspace if its not already in the WS, and returns a reference to it in any case
 :If 0=##.⎕NC'RumbaLean'
 :OrIf enforce
     ##.⎕EX'RumbaLean'
     path←GetAssetPath
     fullpath←##.FilesAndDirs.ExpandPath path,'/Runtime/Rumba/RumbaLean.dws'
     'RumbaLean'##.⎕CY fullpath
     ##.RumbaLean.⎕EX'DRC'
 :EndIf
 ref←##.RumbaLean
 ref←ref.Core
⍝Done
